.TH "CSSUNPARSEDVALUE.KEYS" "3JS" "August 15, 2026" "JavaScript" "JavaScript Reference Manual"
.SH NAME
CSSUnparsedValue.keys \- CSSUnparsedValue: keys() method
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]Note:\f[R] This feature is available in Web Workers.
.PP
The \f[B]\f[CB]keys()\f[B]\f[R] method of the
\f[CR]CSSUnparsedValue\f[R] interface returns a new \f[I]array
iterator\f[R] that yields the index of each item in the object.
.SH SYNTAX
.IP
.EX
keys()
.EE
.SS Parameters
None.
.SS Return value
A new iterable iterator.
.SH EXAMPLES
.SS Iterating over indexes
.IP
.EX
\f[B]const\f[R] value = \f[B]new\f[R] CSSUnparsedValue([\(dq1em\(dq, \(dq#445566\(dq, \(dq\-45px\(dq]);

\f[B]for\f[R] (\f[B]const\f[R] index \f[B]of\f[R] value.keys()) {
  console.log(index);
}
\f[I]// 0\f[R]
\f[I]// 1\f[R]
\f[I]// 2\f[R]
.EE
